'''Passenger liners''' or '''starliners''' were [[starship]]s designed for carrying passengers. Some were present in the [[Hetzal system]] during the [[Great Hyperspace Disaster]].<ref name="LotJ">''[[The High Republic: Light of the Jedi]]''</ref> [[Star Liner Travel]] operated [[Unidentified passenger liner|starliner]] flights including [[Flight 1020]] during the [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="Chapter 5">{{BOBF|Chapter 5: Return of the Mandalorian}}</ref>

